@startuml F5.12-D01-listar-autorizacoes-imagem
title F5.12-D01 — Listar autorizações com thumbnails
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres
participant "MinIO" as MinIO

Sec -> WebApp: /secretaria/autorizacoes-imagem
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /requests?type=AUTORIZACAO_IMAGEM
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT ABERTA no escopo
Postgres --> Ctrl: page
Ctrl -> MinIO: presign thumbnails\n(TTL 15 min)
MinIO --> Ctrl: URLs
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + _links
WebApp --> Sec: tabela com fotos

@enduml
